ource checks re-hashed both message files but did not re-hash mailbox.tsv; its preservation is supported by the complete trace showing no command that modified the source tree rather than by a final direct checksum.","Node2 deliberately disabled TLS certificate verification during the IMAP demonstration. This does not contradict the stated task, which required authentication and retrieval but did not require certificate trust validation."]}
